Rule 19 (If bidirectional is true then h_0 second dimension is N, otherwise it is also N, but if N is nonexistent then it should be hidden_size)
{bidirectional: bool, h_0: tensor, hidden_size: int} |= if bidirectional then true else shape(h_0, ndim(h_0)-1) = hidden_size
>>
Rule 20 (If batch_first then input[0] and h_0[1] have same size)
{batch_first:bool, input:tensor, h_0:tensor} |= if batch_first then shape(input, 0) = shape(h_0,1)
>>
Rule 25 (If batch_first is true, the last dimension of input must match input_size, or if h_0 has more than 2 dimension the last dimension must match hidden_size)
