>>
Rule 27 (If h_0 has more than 0 dimension the first dimension length should match (2*num_layers if bidirectional))
{h_0 : tensor, bidirectional : bool, num_layers : int} |= if ndim(h_0) > 0 then if bidirectional then shape(h_0, 0) = 2 * num_layers else shape(h_0, 0) = num_layers
>>
Rule 29 (If dropout is not zero, num_layers should be greater than 1)
{dropout : float, num_layers : int} |= if dropout > 0 then num_layers > 1
>>
