{dtype : int, input : tensor} |= if dtype ≠ -1 then dtype_(input) = dtype
>>
Rule 66 (If h_0 does not exist, it should be zeros with the correct size, which we can check to some extent)
{h_0: tensor, bidirectional: bool, num_layers: int, hidden_size:int} |= (ndim(h_0) > 0) ∧ shape(h_0, 0) = (if bidirectional then 2 * num_layers else num_layers) ∧ shape(h_0, ndim(h_0) - 1) = hidden_size
>>
